{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50381","headline":"春旦直疏 · 王绩","name":"春旦直疏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春夜犹自长，高窗来月明。\n耿耿不能寐，振衣步前楹。\n怀抱蹔无扰，自觉形神清。\n遐想太古事，俯察今世情。\n淳薄何不同，运数之所成。\n叹息万重隔，已闻晨鸡鸣。\n回看东南隅，□□□□□。\n谁知忘机者，寂泊存其精。\n（见《分门纂类唐歌诗》残本第一册《天地山川类》十三页。\n）（见五卷本《王无功文集》卷二，第十三句「回看」作「回首」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}